  "releaseNotes": "- Renderer.HDR.Dovi: Adds and prefers L1/L3 luminance per-frame metadata when available for PQSpline instead of HDRDetect\n\t\t- Controls.Wpf.PlayerDebug: Introduces I/O Dynamic Range for new HDR implementation\n\n\t\t[Breaking Changes]\n\t\t- Config.Demuxer: Reduces BufferDuration from 30 sec to 3 sec (avoids large memory by default)\n\t\t- Player.Video: Deprecates HDRFormat\n\t\t- ColorSpace Enum: Few renames (uppercases)",
